// `hub` is copied from aa1287221/claude-workbench contracts/side-file/fixtures/waiting-merge at the pinned commit; the
// hub owns it and waiting.test.ts fails when a copy drifts from its sha256. `capture` is frozen output of the real
// producer (scripts/waiting.py) run in a sandbox: the ids are random per run, so it is never regenerated by a test.
// Capture recipe: HOME=<sandbox>/home CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR=<sandbox>/cfg WAITING_HOST=<hosta|hostb> WAITING_MASTER_DIR=<sandbox>/m-<host>
